WEBVTT

00:00.300 --> 00:01.833
This is Trade Levels Pro.

00:01.753 --> 00:04.991
A daily plan for ES and NQ futures,

00:04.991 --> 00:07.059
ready the evening before the session.

00:06.979 --> 00:08.265
Not alerts to chase.

00:08.265 --> 00:10.172
A plan you read before the open.

00:10.522 --> 00:12.624
Each plan ranks the best long levels,

00:12.624 --> 00:13.813
best first.

00:13.733 --> 00:15.483
Level one is the main spot.

00:15.483 --> 00:17.245
The others are deeper backups.

00:17.165 --> 00:18.616
Plus the daily bias,

00:18.616 --> 00:21.295
and a clear line where the long idea is wrong.

00:21.545 --> 00:23.732
Then it tells you what has to happen to go long.

00:23.652 --> 00:25.304
Usually a failed breakdown.

00:25.304 --> 00:27.038
Price flushes below a level,

00:27.038 --> 00:28.257
then reclaims it.

00:28.177 --> 00:28.718
The reclaim is the trigger, not the flush.

00:30.545 --> 00:32.145
Targets are the next levels up.

00:32.065 --> 00:33.675
You take them level to level.

00:35.245 --> 00:37.575
The plan lands by email and Telegram,

00:37.575 --> 00:40.871
and on Today's Plan, by 5:30 PM Eastern.

00:40.791 --> 00:41.867
Want it on your chart?

00:41.867 --> 00:44.790
The TradingView indicator draws the levels for you.

00:45.140 --> 00:47.051
It's for futures and prop-firm traders

00:47.051 --> 00:49.032
who want a plan instead of guessing.

00:49.440 --> 00:52.101
It's not for you if you want signals to copy blindly,

00:52.101 --> 00:53.731
or guaranteed results.

00:53.651 --> 00:54.860
You still make the calls.

00:54.860 --> 00:56.429
The plan gives you structure.

00:56.779 --> 00:58.457
It's $49 a month,

00:58.457 --> 01:00.595
or $490 a year.

01:01.779 --> 01:03.066
Full plan available.

01:02.986 --> 01:03.967
Grab a free sample at

01:03.967 --> 01:07.002
tradelevelspro.com/sample.

01:06.922 --> 01:09.739
Educational only. Not financial advice.
